    C --> D{Validasi Login}

    D -->|Tidak Valid| E[Tampilkan Pesan Error]
    E --> B

    D -->|Valid| F{Cek Role}

    F -->|Admin| G[Dashboard Admin]
    F -->|Sales| H[Dashboard Sales]

    %% =========================
